  "description": "VooDoo Canzo (New) Full Suspension Mountain Bike\n\nThe new Voodoo Canzo shares only its name with its predecessor. Reworked from the ground up, it's now the perfect do-it-all trail bike, featuring 140mm of front and rear travel, a 65° head angle, long top tube, and low stand over with wide 29er wheels and Maxxis tyres.\n\nBoasting a bombproof, low maintenance spec, full RockShox suspension package, and dialled geometry, this bike is not just ready for big days out at the bike park or lapping your local trails; it's engineered to last and designed to rip.\n\nExperience The ALL NEW VooDoo Canzo Pro Full Suspension Mountain Bike that combines advanced engineering with rugged durability, empowering you to tackle the toughest trails and elevate your riding adventures to new heights.",
